  "narrative": "Receiving commands from C&C server The agent awaits C&C commands from the server and inserts them into a command queue that will be executed in a separate thread by MainHandler module. These modules are used for communication with the C&C server, encryption and encoding and - most importantly - for data exfiltration and espionage. InjectApp: Leverages existing higher-level vel interprocess communication mechanisms by sending an kASAppleScriptSuite/ kGetAEUTused event to a process to make it load Apple scripting additions.",
